      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Does spout have audio now? Last time I checked its a technology that is for video, like a shared video texture. \n\nThe general idea of being able to somehow get a differently configured audio out of vrchat is a good idea, I just think it's not going to invoke the SPOUT2 standard.",
