      "value": "Spout does not support audio, it's a video-only system. I would still love to have a way to get clean world audio from the game in order to feed it into my Woojer vest though. Many years ago there was a mod that did this, but ever since that mod stopped working, there hasn't been a way to get a clean world audio feed.",
